.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Local agent and editor config: the dev-server entry that serves this folder
# on a port, and whatever else lands beside it. Machine-specific, and nothing
# here is needed to build, serve, or read the app.
.claude/

# Generated by scripts/pilot.mjs during review, not worth committing.
img/pilot/*/crops/
img/pilot/*/sheet.html

# The working rounds. Six of them, 34 MB, and every one superseded — what they
# taught is written down in §7 of docs/illustration-audit.md, which is the part
# worth keeping. img/pilot/approved/ IS committed: those seven are the artwork
# the restyle gets built from, and until now they existed on one laptop.
img/pilot/round-*/
